    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "McGovern Estates is delighted to present No. 67 Priory Court to the market, a stunning two-bedroom penthouse apartment in the highly sought-after Eden Gate development.\r\n\r\nThis beautifully presented residence boasts a spacious west facing decking area with access from every room, offering wonderful views over the surrounding countryside. \r\n\r\nWell-proportioned rooms are bathed in natural light throughout, with elegant décor and a warm, inviting atmosphere, ideal for relaxing or entertaining with friends.\r\n\r\nThere is ample off-street parking provided within the development.\r\n\r\nLocated just a short stroll from the Eden Gate Shopping Centre, and within easy reach of Delgany village and Greystones Town, this apartment also offers convenient access to public transport links including bus routes and the N11 & M50 road networks.\r\n\r\nThis two bedroom penthouse apartment extends to 72m² (775 sq.ft). The property offers an entrance hall, living room/ kitchen/dining room, two bedrooms, one en suite bathroom and a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nDelgany village and Greystones Town are within easy reach, with a wonderful selection of bistros, boutiques, restaurants and shops, and a large\r\nnumber of highly regarded schools. There are a host of sports and leisure clubs in the area including sailing, rowing, football, rugby, tennis and GAA. The Shoreline Leisure Centre and swimming pool is nearby, as are a great choice of renowned golf clubs, including Delgany, Greystones, Powerscourt and Druids Glen.\r\n\r\nEden Gate is situated in a stunning location close to the coast and the Wicklow mountains, with easy access to local beaches, countryside and the nearby villages of Delgany and Kilcoole.\r\n\r\nThe commuter will be delighted at the close proximity to the N11/M50 and nearby bus and DART routes, offering easy access to the city, airport and beyond.\r\n\r\n*Management €2,700 pa including bins, block insurance & maintenance, 2 parking spaces."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway\r\nLaminated wood flooring, Velux skylight, large storage cloak room. Recessed lighting, intercom security system.\r\n\r\nLiving Room\r\nSpacious living/dining area with laminate wood flooring, sliding doors to the private decking, television point. Recessed lighting. Magnificent views of the surrounding countryside.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room\r\nLaminate wood flooring. Fully fitted kitchen with gloss cream units, dark granite countertops, breakfast bar with seating. Stainless steel sink unit, integrated hob and extractor, Velux skylight.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\nLaminated wood flooring, floor-to-ceiling built-in wardrobes, sliding door to decking. Magnificent views of the surrounding countryside and Sugarloaf Mountain.\r\n\r\nEn Suite\r\nFully tiled shower with mains power shower. Wash hand basin, WC, Velux skylight.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\nLaminated wood flooring, floor to ceiling built-in wardrobe. Sliding door to decking. Magnificent countryside views.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom\r\nFully tiled, bath with telephone shower and glazed screen, wash hand basin, WC. Velux window. Wall heater.\r\n\r\nDecking\r\nThis penthouse apartment benefits from a private west facing decking area with access from every room, enjoying countryside views."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Top floor penthouse apartment\r\nLarge west facing private decking, accessed from every room\r\nTwo double bedrooms, main en suite\r\nImmaculately presented throughout\r\nFully alarmed\r\nBroadband available\r\nServiced by lift\r\nOff street parking\r\nClose to Eden Gate shopping complex\r\nClose to Delgany village and Greystones Town & Marina\r\nN11/M50 road network easily accessible"
      },
      {
